{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/f50c3ac23e3d1c8a4c73e686adb13f43.poster.avif?t=1744107763\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/f50c3ac23e3d1c8a4c73e686adb13f43.webm?t=1744107763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/f50c3ac23e3d1c8a4c73e686adb13f43.mp4?t=1744107763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mathew\u2019s love life is a disaster.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how hard he tries, he just can\u2019t win over a girl\u2014not even his childhood friend, Masha. Frustrated, he takes matters into his own hands, building an advanced android designed to be his perfect match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he runs the final script, something goes wrong\u2026 Instead of a dream girl, he gets a <strong>flawless male android</strong>\u2014a mirror image of himself in both looks and personality. Now, Mathew must deal with the unexpected consequences of his own creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530660/extras/de1e5a3e2365770b9f8471e163f4de1b.webp?t=1744107763\" width=780 height=5 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative:</strong> A humorous and thought-provoking visual novel with 3 different ends influenced by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Characters:</strong> Explore Mathew\u2019s struggles, Masha\u2019s perspective, and his android counterpart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para